ind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest | DeepSpaceSurvivor:EndlessStarfield Demo Gameplay Showcase","summary":"Welcome to the Steam Next Fest gameplay showcase for DeepSpaceSurvivor:EndlessStarfield!Pilot your ship through dangerous star systems in this sci-fi survivors-like. Gather resources, craft and upgrade weapons, and build your own arsenal as swarms of enemies close in.Join this livestream for a look at the demo's space combat, resource gathering, and weapon progression. Play the demo for free now, and if you enjoy this deep-space adventure, add the game to your wishlist!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T03:33:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686048","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599970-1846018067935309","game_id":"steam-4599970","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update Ahead of Steam Next Fest: Combat Improvements, New Content, and a Better Experience","summary":"What's new in the demo:1. Added a new map in the third tier, where you can upgrade superweapons.2. Added new weapons, including the Defense Field and drones.3. Three superweapons are now available, each with upgrades.4. Improved the early-game guidance and added a task system.5. Improved the art assets and early-game experience.Coming in future updates:1. More superweapons.2. More star sectors.3. Improvements to tasks.Please consider adding the game to your wishlist! If you have any feedback or ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T03:44:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935309","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599970-1840310314338017","game_id":"steam-4599970","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is constantly being updated!","summary":"Current updates to the demo:1. Reduced difficulty; increased weapon attack power, speed, and area-of-effect damage.2. Increased enemy density; reduced enemy movement speed and health.3. Added the “Space-Time Rift” gameplay mode.4. Adjusted the ship's movement mechanics.5. Optimized art assets.Upcoming Updates:1. New star systems.2. New weapons.3. More builds and progression paths.4. Other optimizations and adjustments.Feel free to add the game to your Wishlist. If you have any suggestions or fee","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T02:11:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314338017","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599970-1836506165556323","game_id":"steam-4599970","kind":"announcement","title":"🚀 The Demo is Available Now!","summary":"Hello everyone!After several months of development (and a final sprint over the past few weeks), I'm excited to announce that the Deep Space Survivor: EndlessStarfield Demo is now available on Steam!In the current demo, you can experience:🚀 Fast-paced Bullet Heaven combat⚡ Two powerful Super Weapons⛏️ Mine rare space minerals to strengthen your ship👾 Fight through endless enemy fleets in deep space🌌 Explore three playable star systemThis is only the beginning.I'm actively working on new content ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-27T11:47:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165556323","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4599970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:19Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:19Z","error_codes":[]}},"news